},{"words":[{"surface":"சிறுதலைப்","parts":[{"text":"சிறுதலைப்","lemma":"சிறுதலைப்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பிணையிற்","parts":[{"text":"பிணையிற்","lemma":"பிணையிற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"றீர்த்த","parts":[{"text":"றீர்த்த","lemma":"றீர்த்த","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நெறிகோட்","parts":[{"text":"நெறிகோட்","lemma":"நெறிகோட்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"டிரலை","parts":[{"text":"டிரலை","lemma":"இரலை","gloss":"stag"}],"gloss":"stag"},{"surface":"மானையும்","parts":[{"text":"மான்","lemma":"மான்","gloss":"deer"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"accusative"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and the deer"},{"surface":"காண்பர்கொல்","parts":[{"text":"காண்பர்","lemma":"காண்","gloss":"will they see"},{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"particle of doubt"}],"gloss":"will they see?"},{"surface":"நமரே","parts":[{"text":"நமர்","lemma":"நமர்","gloss":"our lover"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"our lover"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புல்லென்","parts":[{"text":"புல்","lemma":"புல்","gloss":"dull"},{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"saying/like"}],"gloss":"dull-colored"},{"surface":"காயா","parts":[{"text":"காயா","lemma":"காயா","gloss":"ironwood tree"}],"gloss":"kāyā tree"},{"surface":"பூக்கெழு","parts":[{"text":"பூ","lemma":"பூ","gloss":"flower"},{"text":"கெழு","lemma":"கெழு","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"filled with flowers"},{"surface":"பெருஞ்சினை","parts":[{"text":"பெருஞ்சினை","lemma":"பெருஞ்சினை","gloss":"large branches"}],"gloss":"large branches","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மென்மயில்","parts":[{"text":"மென்மயில்","lemma":"மென்மயில்","gloss":"soft peacock"}],"gloss":"soft peacock","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"எருத்தில்","parts":[{"text":"எருத்து","lemma":"எருத்து","gloss":"neck"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"locative/like"}],"gloss":"like the neck"},{"surface":"தோன்றும்","parts":[{"text":"தோன்றும்","lemma":"தோன்று","gloss":"appears"}],"gloss":"appears"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கான","parts":[{"text":"கான","lemma":"கானம்","gloss":"forest"}],"gloss":"forest"},{"surface":"வைப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"வைப்பு","lemma":"வைப்பு","gloss":"land/settlement"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"locative/oblique"}],"gloss":"in the land"},{"surface":"புன்புலத்தானே","parts":[{"text":"புன்புலத்தானே","lemma":"புன்புலம்","gloss":"in the dry land"}],"gloss":"in the dry land"}]}],"literal":"In the country he went to, the fresh flowers of the cassia / when they turn pale like us, like themselves / separated from the small-headed female deer, the curved-horned / stag deer, will our lover see? / The dull-colored kāyā's flower-filled large branches / which appear like the neck of a soft peacock / in the forest settlements of the dry land.","translation":"In the country where he has gone, when the fresh blossoms of the cassia turn yellow like us, will our lover see the curved-horned stag separated from his small-headed mate, in the forest settlements of the dry lands where the flower-laden branches of the dark kāyā tree appear like the blue neck of a soft peacock?","modern":"அவர் சென்ற நாட்டில், நம்மைப் போலக் கொன்றையின் பசுமையான மலர்கள் பசலை நிறம் கொள்ளும் காலத்தில், மென்மையான மயிலின் கழுத்தைப் போலத் தோன்றும், பூக்கள் நிறைந்த பெரிய கிளைகளைக் கொண்ட காயா மரங்கள் உள்ள காடுகள் நிறைந்த முல்லை நிலத்து ஊர்களில், சிறிய தலையையுடைய தன் பெண் மானைப் பிரிந்து தவிக்கும் வளைந்த கொம்புகளையுடைய ஆண் மானை நம் காதலர் காண்பாரோ?","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her confidante during the rainy season, which is the time the hero promised to return. She observes the blooming of the cassia and the dark-flowered kāyā trees, which are characteristic of the mullai (forest) landscape. The yellowing of the cassia flowers reminds her of her own paleness caused by separation, while the dark kāyā branches resemble the soft neck of a peacock. She wonders if her lover, seeing a stag separated from its mate in that dry forest land, will feel the pain of their own separation and hasten back to her. The imagery of the separated deer mirrors her own loneliness and longing.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.0],[1.0,1.56],[1.7,2.3],[2.3,2.5],[2.5,3.1],[3.1,3.1],[3.1,3.99],[3.99,5.0],[5.0,5.3],[5.3,6.16],[6.16,6.34],[6.34,7.2],[7.2,8.01],[8.18,8.5],[8.5,8.5],[8.5,8.5],[8.5,8.5],[8.5,10.9],[10.9,12.0],[12.0,12.4],[12.4,12.8],[12.8,13.4],[13.4,13.5],[13.5,14.0],[14.2,14.4]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.0],[1.0,1.72],[1.9,2.06],[2.06,2.88],[2.88,3.7],[3.7,4.08],[4.08,4.64],[4.64,5.64],[5.64,5.72],[5.72,5.72],[5.72,5.72],[5.72,5.72],[5.72,5.72],[5.72,5.72],[5.72,5.72],[5.72,5.72],[5.72,5.8],[5.8,11.8],[11.8,12.9],[12.9,13.5],[13.5,14.0],[14.0,14.7],[14.7,14.8],[14.8,15.47],[15.47,16.0]]}}